# --- Database ---
# Required. The schema's datasource is hardcoded to "postgresql" -- there is
# no SQLite fallback, this must be a real Postgres connection string. Neon
# (https://neon.tech) has a free tier; production runs on Neon via Vercel's
# integration. See README.md/CONTRIBUTING.md for how to get one.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@your-neon-host/starforge?schema=public&sslmode=require"

# --- Auth ---
# Random 32+ char secret used to sign session JWTs. Generate with:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET="replace-with-a-long-random-secret"

# --- Outbound email (verification + welcome emails) ---
# Set RESEND_API_KEY to send real emails via Resend (https://resend.com).
# Without it, the app falls back to a free Ethereal test inbox in dev and
# logs a preview URL to the server console — no setup needed for local dev.
# RESEND_API_KEY="re_..."

# --- App URL ---
# Public base URL of the deployed app, used to build absolute links (e.g. the
# "Open dashboard" link in the welcome email). Falls back to localhost:3000
# if unset, so this MUST be set in production.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="https://portal.starforgerobotics.com"

# --- Web3 / wallet connect ---
# Optional: only needed if you enable WalletConnect (mobile wallets) in
# src/lib/web3-config.ts. Injected wallets (MetaMask, Rabby, etc.) work
# without it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=""

# --- Token airdrop (not wired up yet — reserved for the real on-chain phase) ---
# TREASURY_PRIVATE_KEY=""
# RPC_URL=""
# TOKEN_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=""
